WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.460
The check-in desk: guards, directors, and home rooms.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:09.748
Every guard has a tile, in performance order, with its home room and props.

00:00:09.948 --> 00:00:12.253
Tap Unit check-in when the guard arrives,

00:00:12.453 --> 00:00:19.310
and Director check-in for the director, or whoever is checking in for them. Done ones grey out with the time.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:27.060
If the guard doesn't have a home room yet, pick one. Free rooms are first; a taken room says who has it.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:37.084
Director check-in asks the questions for you. If their props are already here, it says so. If not, ask whether they have a prop or tarp crew today.

00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:42.760
Is their guard with them? Check this, pick a home room, and both are checked in at once.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:52.059
Home rooms shows every hallway area: free, assigned, in use, or cleared and free again. Changing restrooms are listed below.

00:00:52.259 --> 00:00:59.440
Change any guard's home room here, like when there are more guards than rooms and a later guard takes a cleared one.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:06.590
Thanks, check-in crew. Nothing is ever blocked; if something gets missed, H Q sees a flag.
